# Docs and tasks

- `TASKS.md`: status lives only in the status board (`todo | doing | review | done | blocked`). Cards hold details and "Done when" checklists. New task = new ID (never reuse) + board row + card.
- Decisions go in the Decisions table with an ID (`DEC-00X`).
- Schema changes update `docs/firebase/FIREBASE_DESIGN.md`; screen changes update `design/screens/*.md`.
- Daily log: `docs/daily/YYYY-MM-DD.md` — Problem / Solution / Files, short.
- Write plainly: short sentences, tables for comparisons, code blocks for anything to paste.
